VIEWMODEL.md §3.6: a column width outside 16 to 2000 pixels is E1613 (width).
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local record Item {
  label: String
  count: Int
  rank: Int
  level: Int
}

view Item {
  columns { label 8, count 3000, rank 16, level 2000 }
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E1613]  a/a.canon:11:19
  column width 8 is out of range: widths go from 16 to 2000

error[E1613]  a/a.canon:11:28
  column width 3000 is out of range: widths go from 16 to 2000

2 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
